    {
      "id": 7187723550910,
      "title": "La Reina",
      "body_html": "<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">La Reina represents the Geisha varietal which is now synonymous with Panamá coffee because of its distinct flavor and floral tea-like aroma. </span><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">A name inspired by Lilia Ledezma, who was anointed the beauty queen of coffee in Boquete in 1934.</span><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Tasting Notes:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <br></span>Guava<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <br></span>Jasmine<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <br></span>Strawberry<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Varietal: Geisha<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> Process: Washed<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> Altitude: 1500-1600 masl<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <br></span>Farm / Producer: Finca Santa Teresa<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> <br></span>Region: Santa Clara, Renacimiento<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">This coffee is hand-selected, fully-washed, and sun-dried to maintain the finest traditional processing methods. Expect a floral aroma and delicate body best expressed through a filter brew.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span>*Due to the limited nature of these lots, there is a maximum of 2 bags per order. </span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span>*One clip included per order.</span></span></p>",
      "vendor": "Arcane Estate Coffee",
