      "id": 7180469567678,
      "title": "Villa Luna",
      "body_html": "<p>Villa Luna represents the Catuai &amp; Caturra varietals sourced from farms surrounding the family home from which it borrows its name.</p>\n<p>Tasting Notes: <br>Caramel <br>Chocolate <br>Plum</p>\n<p>Varietal: Catuai, Caturra<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Process: Washed<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Altitude: 1400-1600 masl<br>Farm / Producer: Janson Family Estate<br>Region: Volcán, Tierras Altas</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">This coffee is hand-selected, fully-washed, and sun-dried to maintain the finest traditional processing methods. Expect a velvety and full body best expressed through a filter brew.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span>*Due to the limited nature of these lots, there is a maximum of 2 bags per order.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">*One clip included per order.</p>",
