    {
      "id": 7180537135294,
      "title": "Villa Luna Espresso",
      "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Villa Luna represents the Catuai &amp; Caturra varietals sourced from farms surrounding the family home from which it borrows its name.</span></p>\n<p>Tasting Notes:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><br>Brown Sugar<br>Cherry<br>Marzipan</p>\n<p>Varietal: Catuai<br>Process: Washed<br>Altitude: 1400-1600 masl<br>Farm / Producer:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Finca Santa Teresa<br>Region:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Santa Clara, Renacimiento</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">This coffee is hand-selected, fully-washed, and sun-dried to maintain the finest traditional processing methods. Expect an expressive and full-bodied espresso shot.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span>*Due to the limited nature of these lots, there is a maximum of 2 bags per order.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span>*One clip included per order.</span></span></p>",
