    {
      "id": 7187721257150,
      "title": "Villa Luna Natural",
      "body_html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p><span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Villa Luna represents the Catuai &amp; Caturra varietals sourced from farms surrounding the family home from which it borrows its name.</span></p>\n<p>Tasting Notes:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><br>Blood Orange<br>Blueberry<br>Dark Chocolate</p>\n<p>Varietal: Catuai<br>Process: Anaerobic Slow Dry Natural<br>Altitude: 1700-2000 masl<br>Farm / Producer:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> Elida Estate / </span>Lamastus Family<br>Region:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Alto Quiel, Boquete</p>\n<p>This coffee is hand-selected, anaerobically fermented, and sun-dried to maintain the finest natural processing methods. Expect winey acidity and a full body best expressed through a filter brew.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span>*Due to the limited nature of these lots, there is a maximum of 2 bags per order.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span>*One clip included per order.</span></span></p>",
